  "description": "Given a string s, remove duplicate letters so that every letter appears once and the result is the smallest in lexicographical order.",
  "target": "bcabc",
  "pseudocode": "1. count frequencies of all chars\n2. for char in s:\n3.   decrement count[char]\n4.   if char in stack: continue\n5.   while stack and char < stack.top and count[stack.top] > 0:\n6.     visited[stack.pop()] = false\n7.   stack.push(char)\n8.   visited[char] = true",
